                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aa4ba39-5f8c-4a6d-8f66-81426858229d",
                                                "sense_id": "533183f3-1375-3447-87af-fd5723e465e4",
                                                "text": "Wash: Little River gets more colorful by the moment. What'll she do next?\nZoe: Either blow us all up or rub soup in our hair. It's a toss-up.\nWash: I hope she does the soup thing, it's always a hoot and we don't all die from it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5a90251-0578-40b9-99bd-7e76ac4533a6",
                                                "sense_id": "533183f3-1375-3447-87af-fd5723e465e4",
                                                "text": "The Doctor: Oh, this is my friend River. Nice hair, clever, and has her own gun. And unlike me, she really doesn't mind shooting people. I shouldn't like that. Kinda do, a bit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e23b93a-47cc-4da2-97cc-02395fa7a858",
                                                "sense_id": "533183f3-1375-3447-87af-fd5723e465e4",
                                                "text": "Apparently, early in the day, a journalist had decided to bring up his brother River Phoenix's death in his interview, which threw him off and trainwrecked the day for everyone, including me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
